Cell["\<\
Only \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]y\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] is effectively \
non-zero, meaning we differ from the identity only by a rotation around the \
y-axis (which is parallel with our rotation).  Likewise, we see that only \
this middle component has significant variance:\
\>", "Text",
